The condition is the following: the supremum of all the cardinalities $|\mathop{\mathrm{Ob}}\nolimits (\mathcal{X}_{\mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(k)})/\cong |$ and $|\text{Arrows}(\mathcal{X}_{\mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(k)})|$ where $k$ runs over the finite type fields over $S$ is $\leq $ than the size of some object of $(\mathit{Sch}/S)_{fppf}$.